hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2418820/extras/99d804d29a51acbb1bdb0e9165158725.webm?t=1701314439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br>- pleasant graphics;<br>- simple controls;<br>- interesting gameplay;",
